{
  "_note": "W26-04, ruling W26-R5. The roofing service page's product sections. FIVE groups replace the seven catalogue subcategories the filter bar was built from; `from_catalog` says where each old subcategory lands, and the eight redirect pages under /catalog/materiale-acoperis/ keep answering and now aim at the group their subcategory went into. `products` are the imperlux.md models W26-R5 puts first. Each one either FOLDS dasterum.md records in as grades, in which case the card carries the cheaper grade's price and its picture and the folded records are the variants, or it folds none and renders Pret la cerere against a slot of its own that is still empty. NOT TAKEN from imperlux.md: every image (W24-R2), the description sentence under each name, which is marketing rather than a product fact (W25-25's precedent), the struck price, the percent badge (W26-R5, R-X) and THE WARRANTY, which W26-R6 holds until the owner confirms the roof warranty rows. A dasterum.md record whose model name is absent from imperlux.md stays a card of its own and is listed in `dasterum_only`. AMENDED W27-C-03 (W27-R-04, W27-R-05): the imperlux tagline, the named colour chips and the warranty FIGURE on the card are taken from this card on; the percent badge and the struck price still are not, and the warranty ROW in a table still is not (W26-R6).",
